37523>>>>>    Procedure SetActionButtons
37526>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
37526>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
37526>>>>>        Boolean bHasRecord
37526>>>>>        Handle hoDD
37526>>>>>
37526>>>>>        Get Server to hoDD
37527>>>>>        Get GetNavigateData to NavigateData
37528>>>>>        Get HasRecord of hoDD to bHasRecord
37529>>>>>
