37706>>>                Case Break
37707>>>
37707>>>            Case Else // must be nfUndefined
37707>>>                // This may be the start of a drilldown query or this may be used for some kind of custom query.
37707>>>                // If Row select does main-zoom we don't need this
37707>>>                WebSet pbRender of oDetailButton to False
37708>>>
