38419>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to True
38420>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to True
38421>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to bHasRecord
38422>>>>>        End
